# FastAPI

Routers live in `app/api/` and are registered in `main.py` (no `/v1` prefix).

- Pydantic models for request/response (`app/models/schemas.py`); no raw dict bodies
- Shared resources via `Depends()` (`get_current_user`, graphs, LLM)
- Raise `HTTPException` with a real status; never hide errors in HTTP 200
- Blocking work (SQLite, HF models, sync LangGraph) goes in `asyncio.to_thread` / Celery, not directly in `async def`
- Chat streaming: `StreamingResponse`, SSE `data: {json}\n\n` with `token` then `done`
- Auth: JWT Bearer; keep session ownership checks (`session_access`)
